            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of producing a perfusion solution comprisingcombining pre-weighed amounts of a nutrient, a colloid, a hormone, a steroid, a buffer, magnesium sulfate anhydrate, and at least one of a phosphodiesterase inhibitor and a nitrate to form a solution for perfusing a lung at near physiologic conditions.</p>
